  "2d246d4bd6d47297f8967259b454715e11deb771": {
   "body": "Round 1 of Dinis's direction of 02:10 (BRIEF.md). /app/graph/ never draws\nthe whole graph first: it starts from a question (eight presets, or\n\"everything about\" a thing within 1 to 3 steps), each with its own address\n(?q=, ?node=). Filters by kind of thing, verb and label; three layouts (by\nlinks, in order of time, in lanes by kind); pressing a node reads it and\nbrings in its links, with hide and \"open as its own graph\"; pressing a link\nreads the link. The answer is also a list with every item linked.\n/app/graph/ontology/: the kinds of thing and the verbs drawn from the\nontology and the graph; every verb now has an inverse (ontology.json).\n/app/graph/lead-times/: the line of time as its own ",
   "session": "session_018yvwtR8zLQivnC4JDKPoSw",
