  "0fde362b6f1f6e590a6393d170557bc020988b7d": {
   "body": "studio/<id>/ is one explanation's page (the player, then the same storyboard as text); studio/ is a card each. Older\nlinks (/studio/#name/chapter/scene) are sent on. Full screen: button or F, Escape returns. One layout: stage left, the\nchapter's script right (click a line to jump), controls under both; the screen's width is used, up to 1560 px.",
   "session": "session_018yvwtLqxneDnR4p11VDywD",
